on Bouquet","role":"La brancardière"},{"id":5200327,"name":"Clara Lazare","role":"Amie fête"},{"id":3870878,"name":"Mathieu Brassier","role":"Veilleur de nuit"},{"id":1292534,"name":"Mathieu Nicourt","role":"Arbistre freefight"},{"id":4006809,"name":"Thierry Illouz","role":"Avocat"},{"id":5200328,"name":"Ferdinand Mezzafonte","role":"Louis 7 ans"},{"id":5200329,"name":"Philéas Vialard","role":"Fus 10 ans"},{"id":5200330,"name":"Maria Markina","role":"Une etudiante a La Sorbonne"},{"id":5200331,"name":"Franco Provenzano","role":"Le patron du bar (uncredited)"},{"id":3091747,"name":"Denis Simonetta","role":"Un supporter dans les gradins (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Noi e loro","overview":"Il cinquantenne Pierre cresce i suoi due figli da solo. I tre sono molto uniti. Louis, il più giovane, sta per lasciare casa per andare all’università a Parigi.  Fus, un po’ più grande, sta diventando sempre più schivo. Affascinato dalla violenza, milita in gruppi estremisti di destra, l’esatto opposto dei valori del padre. Tra loro ci sono sia amore che odio, finché non giunge la tragedia."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Quiet Son","overview":"Pierre, a devoted father in his 50s, raises his two sons alone. When Louis, the youngest, leaves home to attend the Sorbonne in Paris, Fus, slightly older and not as successful academically, becomes more and more secretive. Driven by a fascination for violence, he gets entangled in far-right extremist groups, at the very opposite of his father’s values. Between them, there is love and hate, until tragedy happens.","tagline":"When filial love collides with the flames of ideology."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Pierre élève seul ses deux fils. Louis, le cadet, réussit ses études et avance facilement dans la vie. Fus, l’aîné, part à la dérive. Fasciné par la violence et les rapports de force, il se rapproche de groupes d’extrême-droite, à l’opposé des valeurs de son père. Pierre assiste impuissant à l’emprise de ces fréquentations sur son fils. Peu à peu, l’amour cède place à l’incompréhension…","tagline":"Quand l’amour filial entre en collision avec les flammes de l’idéologie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ilGApFMmhEP90jsgtqYe2tRKgK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/OhOA3pvYlllL0Bq3Fbb4voHtLe.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1118848,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ilGApFMmhEP90jsgtqYe2tRKgK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ilGApFMmhEP90jsgtqYe2tRKgK.jpg","language":"it","width":1143,"height":1714},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ilGApFMmhEP90jsgtqYe2tRKgK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ilGApFMmhEP90jsgtqYe2tRKgK.jpg","language":"it","width":1143,"height":1714}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CLpEUf9FutbFkLX3PGaKKEqXjf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/CLpEUf9FutbFkLX3PGaKKEqXjf.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/CLpEUf9FutbFkLX3PGaKKEqXjf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/CLpEUf9FutbFkLX3PGaKKEqXjf.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b3yopsSdIqbFjAbJwLAz7UiS5K9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b3yopsSdIqbFjAbJwLAz7UiS5K9.jpg","language":"fr","width":1806,"height":2722},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gxAbiaY765xnlN73iYAsNcLLNG2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gxAbiaY765xnlN73iYAsNcLLNG2.jpg"